{"id":"2bc1263010e83604","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-value-function.md","title":"真值函数","display":"df-truth-value-function — 真值函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-value-function","aliases":["91-df-truth-value-function","91-df-tvf"],"display":"df-truth-value-function — 真值函数","depends_on":["[[91-df-strong-kleene]]","[[91-df-truth-value-gap]]","[[91-df-ground-model]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-value-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-value-function</span><span>91-df-tvf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-value-function — 真值函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fcfe6f023ac58abf\" href=\"?note=fcfe6f023ac58abf\" title=\"91-df-strong-kleene\">91-df-strong-kleene</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8747011468390705\" href=\"?note=8747011468390705\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-gap\">91-df-truth-value-gap</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"253f996295270684\" href=\"?note=253f996295270684\" title=\"91-df-ground-model\">91-df-ground-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-truth-value-function-—-真值函数-$v$\">df-truth-value-function — 真值函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf 3=\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\">\\(\\mathbf 3=\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\\)</span> (强 Kleene 真值集合)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Code}_{T}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner\\mid\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Code}_{T}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner\\mid\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\operatorname{Code}_{T}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\operatorname{Code}_{T}\\)</span> (被接受为真的句子编码信息集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}:\\operatorname{Code}_{T}\\to\\operatorname{Code}_{T}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}:\\operatorname{Code}_{T}\\to\\operatorname{Code}_{T}\\)</span>，\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner)\n=\\ulcorner\\neg\\psi\\urcorner\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner)\n=\\ulcorner\\neg\\psi\\urcorner\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\forall a\\,(a\\in\\Gamma\\to\\operatorname{neg}(a)\\notin\\Gamma)\">\\(\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\forall a\\,(a\\in\\Gamma\\to\\operatorname{neg}(a)\\notin\\Gamma)\\)</span> (信息一致性)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtSent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{AtSent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (基础语言原子句集合)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(v_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (算术原子句在标准模型中的二值赋值)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_{\\rm SK},\\land_{\\rm SK},\\lor_{\\rm SK}\">\\(\\neg_{\\rm SK},\\land_{\\rm SK},\\lor_{\\rm SK}\\)</span> (强 Kleene 运算)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}value\\text{-}function}\\vdash\\quad&amp;\nv_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf 3,\\\\\nv_\\Gamma(\\theta)&amp;\\coloneqq v_{\\mathbb N}(\\theta)\n&amp;&amp;(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{AtSent}_{\\mathcal L_0}),\\\\\nv_\\Gamma(T(\\overline a))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf t,&amp;a\\in\\Gamma,\\\\\n\\mathbf f,&amp;\\operatorname{neg}(a)\\in\\Gamma,\\\\\n\\mathbf u,&amp;\\text{其他情形},\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nv_\\Gamma(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg_{\\rm SK}v_\\Gamma(\\varphi),\\\\\nv_\\Gamma(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\nv_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\\land_{\\rm SK}v_\\Gamma(\\psi),\\\\\nv_\\Gamma(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\nv_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\\lor_{\\rm SK}v_\\Gamma(\\psi),\\\\\nv_\\Gamma(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\inf_{&lt;_t}\\{v_\\Gamma(\\varphi(\\overline n)):n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\nv_\\Gamma(\\exists x\\,\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\sup_{&lt;_t}\\{v_\\Gamma(\\varphi(\\overline n)):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n&amp;&amp;(\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}value\\text{-}function}\\vdash\\quad&amp;\nv_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf 3,\\\\\nv_\\Gamma(\\theta)&amp;\\coloneqq v_{\\mathbb N}(\\theta)\n&amp;&amp;(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{AtSent}_{\\mathcal L_0}),\\\\\nv_\\Gamma(T(\\overline a))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf t,&amp;a\\in\\Gamma,\\\\\n\\mathbf f,&amp;\\operatorname{neg}(a)\\in\\Gamma,\\\\\n\\mathbf u,&amp;\\text{其他情形},\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nv_\\Gamma(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg_{\\rm SK}v_\\Gamma(\\varphi),\\\\\nv_\\Gamma(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\nv_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\\land_{\\rm SK}v_\\Gamma(\\psi),\\\\\nv_\\Gamma(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\nv_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\\lor_{\\rm SK}v_\\Gamma(\\psi),\\\\\nv_\\Gamma(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\inf_{&lt;_t}\\{v_\\Gamma(\\varphi(\\overline n)):n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\nv_\\Gamma(\\exists x\\,\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\sup_{&lt;_t}\\{v_\\Gamma(\\varphi(\\overline n)):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n&amp;&amp;(\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_\\Gamma\">\\(v_\\Gamma\\)</span> : 基于扩展<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>的真值函数</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1, 0, u\">\\(1, 0, u\\)</span> : 真、假、未定义</li>\n</ul>\n<p>真值函数的含义：\n真值函数<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_\\Gamma\">\\(v_\\Gamma\\)</span>将句子映射到真值。真值由真理扩展集<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>决定。</p>\n<p>真值函数的递归定义（强Kleene）：\n这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf f&lt;\\mathbf u&lt;\\mathbf t\">\\(\\mathbf f&lt;\\mathbf u&lt;\\mathbf t\\)</span> 只用于联结词的真值序；\n固定点构造的单调性则使用信息序，二者不能混同。</p>\n<p>真值函数与固定点的关系：\n当<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>是固定点：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"J(\\Gamma) = \\Gamma\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[J(\\Gamma) = \\Gamma\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=J(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Gamma=J(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，则真理原子的解释与由整句递归得到的真值相容：\n对任意句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_\\Gamma(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}))\n=v_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\">\\(v_\\Gamma(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}))\n=v_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>真值函数的作用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>定义三值语义</li>\n<li>计算句子的真值</li>\n<li>构造固定点</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-truth-value-function-—-真值函数-$v$","text":"df-truth-value-function — 真值函数 $v$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-strong-kleene","status":"resolved","id":"fcfe6f023ac58abf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","locat